<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=edge" />
  <title>{{subject}}</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #2c3e50;
      background-color: #ecf0f1;
      padding: 20px 0;
    }
    .wrapper {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .container {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }
    .header-section {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #27ae60 0%, #1e8449 100%);
      padding: 50px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #ffffff;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .header-section::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -50%;
      right: -10%;
      width: 300px;
      height: 300px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }
    .header-section::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -30%;
      left: -5%;
      width: 200px;
      height: 200px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }
    .header-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .header-section .logo {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .header-section h1 {
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    }
    .header-section .subtitle {
      font-size: 15px;
      opacity: 0.95;
      font-weight: 400;
    }
    .content-section {
      padding: 40px 30px;
    }
    .greeting {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .greeting strong {
      color: #27ae60;
    }
    .success-banner {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.1) 0%, rgba(30, 132, 73, 0.05) 100%);
      border: 1px solid #d5f4e6;
      border-left: 4px solid #27ae60;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 24px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .success-banner-text {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #27ae60;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .success-banner-time {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #1e8449;
    }
    .details-section {
      background-color: #f0f6ff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .details-section-title {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #2c3e50;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .details-section-title::before {
      content: '📋';
      margin-right: 8px;
    }
    .detail-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 12px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ecf0f1;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .detail-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .detail-label {
      color: #7f8c8d;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .detail-value {
      color: #2c3e50;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: right;
    }
    .detail-value.amount {
      color: #27ae60;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .detail-value.status {
      color: #27ae60;
      background-color: #d5f4e6;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .info-text {
      color: #34495e;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin: 24px 0;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    .cta-section {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 32px 0;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 40px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #27ae60 0%, #1e8449 100%);
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 15px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.4);
    }
    .button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.6);
    }
    .security-note {
      background-color: #fff5f5;
      border-left: 4px solid #e74c3c;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 24px 0;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #741d28;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .security-note strong {
      color: #5a1620;
    }
    .divider {
      height: 1px;
      background-color: #ecf0f1;
      margin: 32px 0;
    }
    .footer-section {
      background-color: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #ecf0f1;
    }
    .footer-text {
      color: #7f8c8d;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .footer-text strong {
      color: #34495e;
    }
    .footer-link {
      color: #667eea;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .footer-link:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header-section">
        <div class="header-content">
          <div class="logo">CameYo</div>
          <h1>✓ Pago Confirmado</h1>
          <p class="subtitle">Transacción procesada exitosamente</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="content-section">
        <div class="greeting">Hola <strong>{{userName}}</strong>,</div>

        <div class="success-banner">
          <div class="success-banner-text">✓ Tu pago ha sido confirmado</div>
          <div class="success-banner-time">Procesado el {{paymentDate}} a las {{paymentTime}}</div>
        </div>

        <div class="details-section">
          <div class="details-section-title">Detalles de la Transacción</div>

          <div class="detail-row">
            <span class="detail-label">Referencia de Pago</span>
            <span class="detail-value">{{transactionId}}</span>
          </div>

          <div class="detail-row">
            <span class="detail-label">Monto</span>
            <span class="detail-value amount">${{amount}} COP</span>
          </div>

          <div class="detail-row">
            <span class="detail-label">Método de Pago</span>
            <span class="detail-value">{{paymentMethod}}</span>
          </div>

          <div class="detail-row">
            <span class="detail-label">Estado</span>
            <span class="detail-value status">✓ Confirmado</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="info-text">
          Tu solicitud de servicio ha sido confirmada y se procesará en breve. Recibirás actualizaciones sobre el estado de tu servicio en tiempo real a través de tu panel de CameYo.
        </p>

        <div class="cta-section">
          <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="button">Ver Estado del Servicio</a>
        </div>

        <div class="security-note">
          <strong>🔒 Seguridad:</strong> Si no reconoces esta transacción o tienes dudas sobre el cargo, contacta a nuestro equipo de soporte inmediatamente. No compartiremos tu información financiera con terceros.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-section">
      <p class="footer-text">
        © {{year}} <strong>CameYo</strong> | Conectando técnicos verificados con clientes confiables
      </p>
      <p class="footer-text" style="margin-top: 12px;">
        Soporte: <a href="mailto:support@camey.co" class="footer-link">support@camey.co</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
